#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:5
#: fed95820c2ae43339772c9c54a853d7a
msgid "Copter Use-Case Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:7
#: db126284e60d4326b9cd1f87988c9714
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of some of the main use cases for "
"Copter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:11
#: b57520579c3a4441a584b8706197ec94
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:13
#: 976c01041ad848cb9e6d9a741b3b1285
msgid ""
"The Copter autopilot provides a stable flying platform that enables "
"precise manual and automated control over vehicle position, speed, "
"orientation and actions. The supported control behaviours are made "
"available using autopilot :ref:`flight/control modes <flight-modes>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:18
#: c4128a069aea4b3d953c614efd5122a5
msgid ""
"Manual flight modes like :ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>`, :ref:`Alt "
"Hold <altholdmode>` and :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` provide different "
"types of stabilisation and make vehicles easier to fly and position. "
"Other manual modes like :ref:`Follow Me <ac2_followme>` and :ref:`RTL "
"(Return-to-Launch) <rtl-mode>` automate tasks that would otherwise "
"require complex manual adjustments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:26
#: b653986c92e44297ab283ac9d2962f0a
msgid ""
":ref:`AUTO Mode <auto-mode>` allows you to run complex missions that you "
"can define using a :ref:`ground control station <common-choosing-a"
"-ground-station>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:28
#: 4f9b013120634af7abef0531d2223dbf
msgid ""
"A companion computer on the vehicle can communicate with/control Copter "
"(for example, using `DroneKit-Python <https://github.com/dronekit"
"/dronekit-python/>`__) and perform computationally intensive low-latency "
"tasks like computer-vision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:33
#: 2bd9038a3adf4d03b36e9295059466cc
msgid ""
"This stability and precision, and the flexibility in terms of manual and "
"automated control, make Copter the ideal platform for many UAV "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:37
#: b6009d066d0d4bffa7589b2cb9fed52c
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of some of the main use cases, with "
"special emphasis on those requiring photographic/video inspection or "
"payload delivery in difficult-to-reach places."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:43
#: 827e27a60d3e400093f712b21093614b
msgid ""
"Additional use cases and information are covered in the section :ref:`Use"
" Cases and Applications <common-use-cases-and-applications>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:47
#: cb6e1f25db734c568ea611a536ecef56
msgid "Still and Video Photography"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:49
#: de914bf4b328468fa99c19e867e8b5ff
msgid ""
"Copter allows you to easily get to locations and take pictures/video that"
" would otherwise be difficult (or impossible) to reach. For this reason, "
"photography applications are currently the most highly developed use-"
"case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:54
#: 1e7e131948374e84b4724fa0ba706557
msgid ""
"Copter provides a stable platform for photography, with additional "
"stability and independent control of camera position (relative to the "
"vehicle) provided by brushless camera gimbals. Copter supports camera-"
"friendly flight modes like :ref:`Follow Me <ac2_followme>` and allows you"
" to control/maintain the camera target at a specific region of interest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:60
#: 17264323c24e4fa3ae3b1dd974ac8d4a
msgid ""
"Advanced systems like `3DR Solo implement even more advanced "
"vehicle/camera control (\"smart shots\") using `DroneKit-Python "
"<https://dronekit.io/>`__ running on a Companion Computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:65
#: c38759b99dad4c7c809db64c6e8b9ed9
msgid "First Person View (FPV)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:67
#: a89f890ec5ae456f9d9bb21020d8e6de
msgid ""
"*First Person View* allows you to fly your copter from the perspective of"
" an actual on board pilot. This use case is discussed in the topic "
":ref:`First Person View (FPV) <common-fpv-first-person-view>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:72
#: b925dd19610c4ebb94c297fe797f83c0
msgid "Disaster response"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:74
#: b9913a3e10644640837f91a1eb18ce27
msgid ""
"Copters can help save lives/provide relief in the event of major "
"disasters (fires, flood, tornadoes, earthquakes, volcanic eruptions etc)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:78
#: 22cd844b1b194568ba19c448a6f2296a
msgid ""
"They are particularly useful for search and survey tasks, and for "
"delivery of low-weight critical supplies, information and assistance. "
"They can do this relatively cheaply without putting additional lives at "
"risk (freeing up other resources to do actual recovery)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:84
#: 0d782dabab874b25954dd722d67c3599
msgid "Search (and rescue)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:86
#: e2f3be8897b1425dac8fb872144b9dda
msgid ""
"Copter makes an excellent platform for locating missing individuals and "
"groups. Vehicles can perform a grid search and take photographs for "
"either on-board (using a companion computer) or later analysis. Copter "
"can search in hard-to-reach areas, and may be used in large numbers due "
"to their low cost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:94
#: 36a4fc9894db4c46973e94604bf9ed0c
msgid ""
"Fixed wing vehicles have much greater range than Copter, and may be more "
"suitable for searching large areas with low ground-cover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:98
#: 51adbb079e654301b3079d00ec37fa16
msgid "Agricultural applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:100
#: d97d52855d1246bb92ed65108711e8b9
msgid ""
"Agricultural inspection is a growing field for UAV applications. Examples"
" include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:103
#: 751a4fac0da740a8a1df6b207c628f10
msgid "Tile and drainage inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:104
#: fef76fee5b16421ca6a8817185b443fa
msgid "Barn roof and silo inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:105
#: 446bc8c1cd444a5995a18c7ab788a643
msgid "Irrigation pivot inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:106
#: f78e0d71cada48519416bfee02392e9c
msgid "Hail and cattle damage inspection for crop insurance claims"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:107
#: cfe9b2ff53ee4d70bf23b56c0fe218a4
msgid "Scare off pest-wildlife that eat crops"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:108
#: 498fb3edfd47401e81ed3e206e2adc1d
msgid "Patrol for hunters on your private land"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:109
#: 93240306dff64441aa5cb8b606eb9f23
msgid "Locate missing cattle (This is where a thermal camera comes in handy.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:111
#: ade644ec4605474d9fd82f51c62681db
msgid "Video check-ins for landlords"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:115
#: 999291c3dc734cd79b2f8e2a9cd9e58f
msgid ""
"This promises to be one of the most important and earliest adopted "
"civilian uses of Multicopters. One benefit is that there are fewer "
"restrictions when flying over private land."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:120
#: 370c893d2bea42839c048b674f75eebe
msgid "Forest fire mitigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:122
#: 928c5539c87f40bbba342ebcb098aacd
msgid ""
"Copter has great potential for fire monitoring and detection (with an "
"infrared camera, a Plane or Copter UAV can detect small camp fires even "
"in heavy tree cover)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:127
#: 97fb4ee32865427e887c995d2f2430e6
msgid "Hazard/danger mitigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:129
#: 1137465dce44469fba69601d4215b3ec
msgid ""
"More generally, Copter and Plane are useful for other hazard mitigation "
"as a cost-effective alternative to patrolling using airplanes, "
"helicopters, or ground-based services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:133
#: e096fc1e82d549e2b62e5db2f24ec6a5
msgid ""
"They are already being used for shark patrols in beach areas, and there "
"is no reason they could not similarly be used in any other \"patrol\" "
"activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:138
#: 0c65f72456ea411688bde9bc7cc3334e
msgid "3D Mapping and GIS (Geographic Information Systems)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:140
#: 7af53f9069ef429b801ba4b8655b52f3
msgid ""
"Copter makes an effective 3D Mapping platform with a wide variety of "
"potential applications. For more information see the topic :ref:`3D "
"Mapping <common-3d-mapping>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:144
#: d8b910351c1f45cdbfa1f85e83caf351
msgid "Inspection, Verification and Sample Collection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:146
#: d66ae5431d0c4a00be9931a0438a2080
msgid ""
"Architectural and building inspection/verification are possibly the "
"fastest growing UAV use case - due to the obvious benefits to being able "
"to check construction quality and condition without having to create "
"expensive scaffolding and other safety infrastructure. Copter is "
"similarly useful for contour analysis, drainage and verifying adherence "
"to plans."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:153
#: 891a2b9f020d47368bbbc2362130cdc4
msgid ""
"Copter is also useful for sample collection in difficult to reach or "
"hazardous areas (this requires that the vehicle is fitted with a small "
"probe or other sample device). The `Modcopter Sample Collection System "
"<https://permalink.lanl.gov/object/tr?what=info:lanl-repo/lareport/LA-"
"UR-13-23300>`__ is an excellent government-backed student project for "
"accessing a variety of samples."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:160
#: 9c4aec02a1a44dbd957d2e9e80cda9d8
msgid "Payload Based Applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:162
#: a81560450fed47bdaad4f7e9f76c3add
msgid ""
"Copter is suitable for delivery of low-mass emergency supplies, including"
" flotation devices, communications devices, shark repellent etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:166
#: 54a83a20d6a242ae9b1f587847cb5ad8
msgid ""
"There are active investigations into other commercial applications "
"including crop spraying and package delivery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:170
#: 837856497620434ca3c426c060f4c618
msgid "Other applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:172
#: 82513f6529904142a762dae8d2bdcd96
msgid "Copters are being used or considered in many other applications:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:174
#: ae68c2dc3292486f8a7c7ed86e1329ee
msgid "Initial \"pilot line\" stringing for power lines from hilltop to hill top."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:176
#: 8a7f8034a924449591dc32aa02995737
msgid "Painting, touch up and maintenance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:177
#: cbe32cf0cfbd433f8fe7725a900f050a
msgid "Tree trimming and spraying."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:178
#: adbfece219784565a2600b964a66a7dc
msgid "Building and home cleaning."
msgstr ""

